{x} = \\dfrac{1}{\\cosh{x}} = \\dfrac{2}{e^x+e^{-x}}\\,\\,\\,\n$$\n\nThe graph of $y=\\sech x$ is shown below.\n\n![](images/b2/b228f9fba9d1b981d64730de4b3836de914e2565332780a3fd803c165fb7d2ba.png)\n\nNote the following properties of $y=\\sech x$:\n\n- Its domain is $x \\in (-\\infty, \\infty)$.\n- Its range is $y \\in (0, 1]$.\n- It has the horizontal asymptote $y=0$.\n- It is an even function." 13194139535589 17592186045417 false] [17592186168105 1064 "The **hyperbolic secant function** (pronounced \"sesh\") is defined as \n![](images/e7/e7c30afe931272f96d3af0ae8b020cd011c0d3a16bc299bf6afb58a3853d5923.svg)\nThe graph of ![](images/b6/b63b49cef7052e7402e9f894d46b94ffb2f406b51d57402272dba5aade93a508.svg) is shown below.\n\n![](images/b2/b228f9fba9d1b981d64730de4b3836de914e2565332780a3fd803c165fb7d2ba.png)\n\nNote the following properties of ![](images/e8/e82bcae39f329ede047f75bb74921d7a2a9d55f74b529a98fee4581b87d35849.svg)\n\n- Its domain is ![](images/aa/aa2627839a0a228b0c54166eb26bf5943e21bbb690d71d1059b5bad6f36d72bd.svg)\n\n- Its range is ![](images/70/70c4b1eec58c8b8a94bc35b936d5d3ce5ea71f302517d16eb81e3fa7adf7afec.svg)\n\n- It has a horizontal asymptote ![](images/6c/6c63827e94b6c11a9803605bd54156d90d3fcc6ff4639dd179a5fb024bcffaa1.svg)\n\n- It is an even function." 13194139535589 17592186045417 true] [17592186168106 1064 "The **hyperbolic cotangent function** (pronounced \"coth\") is defined as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\coth x = \\frac{1}{\\tanh x} &= \\frac{e^{x} + e^{-x}}{e^{x} - e^{-x}}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe graph of $y=\\coth x$ is shown below.\n\n![](images/d3/d3d4f5cbe846f7725399fa1b1769c4f476be439575043537a2caa80c318a5ec9.png)\n\nNote the following properties of $y=\\coth x$:\n\n- Its domain is $x\\in (-\\infty, 0)\\cup (0,\\infty)$.\n- Its range is $y \\in (-\\infty, -1)\\cup (1,\\infty)$.\n- It has horizontal asymptotes $y=\\pm 1$.\n- It is an odd function.\n\nUsing the alternative definitions of $\\tanh x$, we can write down two more definitions